{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.20260528095116","title":"Daftar holy angels di 1 Enoch berfungsi sebagai peta peran kosmik","desc":"Dalam 1 Enoch, holy angels bekerja sebagai administrator domain yang menjaga order, sehingga daftar nama itu berfungsi sebagai struktur peran kosmik, bukan trivia.","updated":1779939661606,"created":1779936739572,"tags":["zettel","enoch","agency","angels"],"custom":{},"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"70dd2af09e6abcfe8e4c5a8a2afe546e","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.zettel","alias":"zettel","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.zettel"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.enoch","alias":"enoch","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.enoch"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.agency","alias":"agency","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.agency"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.angels","alias":"angels","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.angels"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":3,"offset":582},"end":{"line":7,"column":48,"offset":627},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.20260528095116","id":"zettel.20260528095116","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7","position":{"start":{"line":8,"column":3,"offset":630},"end":{"line":8,"column":61,"offset":688},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7"}}],"anchors":{},"children":[],"parent":"zettel","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"daftar-holy-angels-di-1-enoch-berfungsi-sebagai-peta-peran-kosmik\">Daftar holy angels di 1 Enoch berfungsi sebagai peta peran kosmik<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#daftar-holy-angels-di-1-enoch-berfungsi-sebagai-peta-peran-kosmik\"></a></h1>\n<p>Dalam 1 Enoch, daftar nama holy angels bukan sekadar literatur pelengkap. Ia berfungsi sebagai peta peran kosmik: Uriel, Raphael, Raguel, Michael, Saraqael, Gabriel, dan Remiel masing-masing ditugaskan pada domain berbeda seperti dunia, roh manusia, luminaries, chaos, dosa spirit, Paradise, dan kebangkitan.</p>\n<p>Klaim ini berguna untuk membedakan dua jenis pengawasan dalam Enoch: pengawasan yang benar oleh holy angels, yang menjalankan tugas dalam order, dan pengawasan yang rusak oleh Watchers yang jatuh, yang keluar dari tempat dan waktu yang ditetapkan.</p>\n<p>Referensi internal:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/book-summaries.the-complete-book-of-enoch\">The Complete Book of Enoch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.literature.the-complete-book-of-enoch-chapter-7\">The Complete Book of Enoch Chapter 7 sebagai literature note</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a class=\"color-tag\" style=\"--tag-color: #a03623;\" href=\"/sotoy/notes/tags.zettel\">zettel</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">enoch (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">agency (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">angels (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>","no